        </Packager>
        <Summary>Stream games and other applications from another PC running Sunshine or GeForce Experience</Summary>
        <Description>Moonlight can stream games and other applications from another PC with Sunshine or GeForce Experience software installed.
        Features include:
        
        * Hardware accelerated video decoding with VAAPI, VDPAU, and NVDEC support
        * H.264, HEVC, and AV1 codec support
        * 7.1 surround sound audio support
        * 10-point multitouch support
        * Gamepad support with force feedback for up to 16 players
        * Support for both pointer capture (for games) and direct mouse control (for remote desktop)
        * Support for passing system-wide keyboard shortcuts like Alt+Tab to the host
        </Description>
        <License>GPL-3.0+</License>
        <Archive sha1sum="0396157cc024d8c9e9aceea7ed47b80b29ba203b" type="binary">https://github.com/moonlight-stream/moonlight-qt/releases/download/v6.1.0/Moonlight-6.1.0-x86_64.AppImage</Archive>

        <BuildDependencies>
            <Dependency>binutils</Dependency>
            <Dependency>libxscrnsaver</Dependency>
        </BuildDependencies>
    </Source>

